# Nothing here is built. The app is these files, served exactly as they are,
# so this list is not about build output — it is about what an operating
# system, an editor or a stray download leaves next to the source, and what
# `git add -A` would otherwise sweep in.

# Operating system clutter
.DS_Store
Thumbs.db
desktop.ini

# Editors
.vscode/
.idea/
*.swp
*~

# Local Claude Code state. .claude/launch.json is deliberately NOT ignored:
# it is how the dev server starts, and whoever inherits this needs it.
.claude/settings.local.json
.claude/*.local.json

# Secrets. None exist today — the weather API takes no key and there is no
# backend — and if that ever changes, a static site cannot keep a secret
# anyway: anything shipped to the browser is public. This is here so a stray
# .env never gets committed on the way to finding that out.
.env
.env.*
!.env.example

# Only if tooling is ever added — there is none today, and the app is meant
# to stay buildable by whoever inherits it without installing anything.
node_modules/
*.log

# Scratch. The course mapper exports JSON through the browser's download
# folder; a copy saved here by hand belongs pasted into data/course.json,
# not committed beside it.
*.tmp
scratch/
